  "description": "Cross-platform UI library written 100% in TokenVector (.tkv) with zero third-party runtime dependencies: software rasterizer, bitmap+TTF font (Vietnamese-first 134 precomposed glyphs), effects, flex/grid layout, 93 widget constructors (42 widgets + 41 native-look + 10 media-player), theme engine, model/view, pure-.tkv SQLite + PDF writer, A11y/UIA/AT-SPI bridges, Telex/VNI IME, GIF/TKVV/MJPEG/MP4 codecs, packaging and WASM tooling. Compiled with tkvc.exe.",
  "iconUrl": "https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.0-blue",
  "id": "TokenVector.UI",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-24T06:04:04.883Z",
