  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 (2026-09-24): first packaged release. verify 55/0/2 TKVUI_VERIFY_OK (~2200+ checks). Catalog 93 constructors (Widgets 42 + Native 41 + Media 10). Wave A+B: calendar/datetime/toolbox/stacked/scrollbar/dial/commandlink/keyseq/lcd/tourtip + dock float/tab, MDI tile, ribbon, property grid, tree multi-select, context menu. Qt ports QtAppPort 52/52 + QtTreeDockPort 31/31. HarfBuzz wire text_atlas_draw_shaped. Built-in SQLite 132/132 + PDF 63/63. GIF/TKVV/MJPEG/MP4 pure .tkv. Bench vs PyQt6: text 9.4ms (~1.9x), paint 1000 btn ~30ms, SQL file RT 81ms (~2.4x). Full details: RELEASE_NOTES.md.",
  "repository": {
